                  <run>Æ&#10;&#10;&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='12'>% On Time :  Total on-time orders / Total Valid Orders</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='12'><![CDATA[On-Time Orders (Food is Ready):  Ready for pickup <= estimated_pickup_at_local ]]></run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='12'><![CDATA[On-Time Orders (EPT):  Actual Prep Time <= EPT]]></run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;&#10;&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='12'>EPT (mins) : Estimated Vendor Prep Time based on prediction model</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='12'>Actual Prep Time (mins) : food_is_ready_at_local  - sent_to_vendor_at_local</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;&#10;&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='12'>sent_to_vendor_at_local : Vendor was notified about order</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='12'>estimated_pickup_at_local : Order expected to be picked up</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='12'>food_is_ready_at_local : Ready for Pickup or Food is ready</run>
